    <Item>\textbf{Data Privacy:} If smart features added, transparent data policies</Item>
    <Item>\textbf{Fair Labor:} Ensure supplier compliance with labor standards</Item>

</Itemize>
<p>\textbf{Social Features to Avoid:}</p>
<Itemize>

    <Item>\textbf{Aggressive Anti-Theft:} No designs that could harm thieves (liability, ethical concerns)</Item>
    <Item>\textbf{Surveillance Features:} Avoid cameras or tracking that could violate privacy norms</Item>
    <Item>\textbf{Exclusionary Design:} Ensure usable by people with various physical abilities</Item>

</Itemize>
<p>\callout</p>
